#ROOMS

#94000
"Mountain Cavern"
"You stand within a large natural cavern deep in the heart of the earth.
Patches of naturally luminescent moss adhere to the cavern ceiling high
overhead providing a fair bit of light.  South of here lies a massive chasm
that cuts a wide swatch across the entire cavern.  Further still you can make
out another ledge opposite this one but it is clearly much too far to reach
even if you were to jump.  To the north a tall arch, well larger than an ogre,
is formed by cleanly dressed stones set into the cavern wall.
"
"need tram code
"
